					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr" data-mw-parsoid-version="0.24.0.0-alpha22" data-mw-html-version="2.8.0"><section data-mw-section-id="0" id="mwAQ"><p class="mw-empty-elt" id="mwAg"><span typeof="mw:Nowiki mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt1" id="mwAw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Short description","href":"./Template:Short_description"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"none"}},"i":0}}]}'></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_with_short_description" about="#mwt1"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Short_description_is_different_from_Wikidata" about="#mwt1" id="mwBA"/>
<span typeof="mw:Nowiki mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt2" id="mwBQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"pp-semi-indef","href":"./Template:Pp-semi-indef"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'></span><meta typeof="mw:Extension/indicator" about="#mwt2" id="mwBg" data-mw='{"name":"indicator","attrs":{"name":"pp-default"},"body":{"extsrc":"[[File:Semi-protection-shackle.svg|20px|link=Wikipedia:Protection policy#semi|alt=Page semi-protected|This article is semi-protected.]]"}}'/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Wikipedia_indefinitely_semi-protected_pages#Wikipedia%20logo" about="#mwt2" id="mwBw"/></p>
<figure class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwCA"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwCQ"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/80/Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg/250px-Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/80/Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg/500px-Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="103" data-file-height="94" data-file-type="drawing" height="228" width="250" class="mw-file-element" id="mwCg"/></a><figcaption id="mwCw">Logo of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia" title="Wikipedia" id="mwDA">Wikipedia</a></figcaption></figure> 
<figure class="mw-default-size mw-default-audio-height" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwDQ"><span id="mwDg"><audio controls="" preload="none" data-mw-tmh="" height="32" width="250" style="width: 250px;" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Wikimedia_Sonic_Logo_-_4-seconds.wav" data-durationhint="4" class="mw-file-element" id="mwDw"><source src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/91/Wikimedia_Sonic_Logo_-_4-seconds.wav?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=original" type="audio/wav" id="mwEA"/><source src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/91/Wikimedia_Sonic_Logo_-_4-seconds.wav/Wikimedia_Sonic_Logo_-_4-seconds.wav.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" data-transcodekey="mp3" id="mwEQ"/><source src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/91/Wikimedia_Sonic_Logo_-_4-seconds.wav/Wikimedia_Sonic_Logo_-_4-seconds.wav.ogg" type='audio/ogg; codecs="vorbis"' data-transcodekey="ogg" id="mwEg"/></audio></span><figcaption id="mwEw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sound_logo" title="Sound logo" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFA">Sound logo</a> of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikimedia" title="Wikimedia" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFQ">Wikimedia</a> (including Wikipedia)<sup about="#mwt6" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-1"}}'><a href="#cite_note-1" id="mwFg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwFw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwGA">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwGQ">]</span></span></a></sup></figcaption></figure>
<p id="mwGg">The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Logo" title="Logo" id="mwGw">logo</a> of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Online_encyclopedia" title="Online encyclopedia" id="mwHA">online encyclopedia</a> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia" title="Wikipedia" id="mwHQ">Wikipedia</a> depicts a white, incomplete <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Globe" title="Globe" id="mwHg">globe</a>-shaped <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jigsaw_puzzle" title="Jigsaw puzzle" id="mwHw">jigsaw puzzle</a>, each jigsaw piece inscribed with a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Glyph" title="Glyph" id="mwIA">glyph</a> from a different <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Writing_system" title="Writing system" id="mwIQ">writing system</a>. As displayed on the web pages of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_Wikipedia" title="English Wikipedia" id="mwIg">the English-language edition</a> of the project, there is the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wordmark" title="Wordmark" id="mwIw">wordmark</a> "WIKIPEDIA" (styled as <style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r920966791" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt7" id="mwJA" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"smallcaps/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"small caps","href":"./Template:Small_caps"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"WikipediA"}},"i":0}}]}'>.mw-parser-output span.smallcaps{font-variant:small-caps}.mw-parser-output span.smallcaps-smaller{font-size:85%}</style><span class="smallcaps" about="#mwt7" id="mwJQ">WikipediA</span><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1152813436" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt9" id="mwJg" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Screen reader-only/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sronly","href":"./Template:Sronly"},"params":{"1":{"wt":" (in small caps, with the leading W and trailing A taller than the other letters)"}},"i":0}}]}'>.mw-parser-output .sr-only{border:0;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);clip-path:polygon(0px 0px,0px 0px,0px 0px);height:1px;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:absolute;width:1px;white-space:nowrap}</style><span class="sr-only" about="#mwt9" id="mwJw"> (in small caps, with the leading W and trailing A taller than the other letters)</span>) beside the globe, and below that, the text "The Free Encyclopedia" in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Open_source" title="Open source" id="mwKA">open-source</a> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Linux_Libertine" title="Linux Libertine" id="mwKQ">Linux Libertine</a> font.<sup about="#mwt13" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-font1_2-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"font1"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-font1-2"}}'><a href="#cite_note-font1-2" id="mwKg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwKw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLA">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLQ">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt16" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-3"}}'><a href="#cite_note-3" id="mwLg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwLw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMA">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMg">The unfinished puzzle symbolizes the project's state as a perpetual work in progress.</p>

<meta property="mw:PageProp/toc" id="mwMw" data-mw='{"autoGenerated":true}'/></section><section data-mw-section-id="1" id="mwNA" aria-labelledby="Design_and_history"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Design_and_history">Design and history</h2></div>
<section data-mw-section-id="2" id="mwNQ" aria-labelledby="Early_logos_(2001)"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Early_logos_(2001)"><span id="Early_logos_.282001.29" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span>Early logos (2001)</h3></div>
<figure class="mw-default-size mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwNg"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Old_wikipedia_logo.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwNw"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Old_wikipedia_logo.png" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9f/Old_wikipedia_logo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-file-width="113" data-file-height="110" data-file-type="bitmap" height="110" width="113" class="mw-file-element mw-file-upright" style="--mw-file-upright: 0.9" id="mwOA"/></a><figcaption id="mwOQ">The first Wikipedia logo</figcaption></figure>
<p id="mwOg">In January 2001, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jimmy_Wales" title="Jimmy Wales" id="mwOw">Jimmy Wales</a> used the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flag_of_the_United_States" title="Flag of the United States" id="mwPA">flag of the United States</a> as a placeholder logo for Wikipedia's <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UseModWiki" title="UseModWiki" id="mwPQ">UseModWiki</a> instance.<sup about="#mwt19" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-4"}}'><a href="#cite_note-4" id="mwPg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwPw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwQA">[</span>4<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwQQ">]</span></span></a></sup> Wikipedia's first true logo was an image originally submitted by Bjørn Smestad—under the username <i id="mwQg">Bjornsm</i>—for a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nupedia" title="Nupedia" id="mwQw">Nupedia</a> logo competition which took place in 2000.<sup about="#mwt22" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-5" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-5"}}'><a href="#cite_note-5" id="mwRA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwRQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRg">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRw">]</span></span></a></sup> It was used provisionally as Wikipedia's logo until the end of 2001.<sup about="#mwt23" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-second_6-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"second"}}'><a href="#cite_note-second-6" id="mwSA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwSQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwSg">[</span>6<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwSw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwTA">The logo included a quote from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Page:Carroll%20-%20Euclid%20and%20His%20Modern%20Rivals.djvu/14" title="s:Page:Carroll - Euclid and His Modern Rivals.djvu/14" class="extiw" id="mwTQ">preface</a> of the 1879 book <i id="mwTg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Euclid_and_his_Modern_Rivals" title="Euclid and his Modern Rivals" class="mw-redirect" id="mwTw">Euclid and his Modern Rivals</a></i> by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lewis_Carroll" title="Lewis Carroll" id="mwUA">Lewis Carroll</a>. It utilized the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fisheye_lens" title="Fisheye lens" id="mwUQ">fisheye</a> effect to make the text appear to be wrapped onto a sphere, leaving only part of it readable. The used text was (visible text in <strong about="#mwt24" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwUg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"strong","href":"./Template:Strong"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"bold"}},"i":0}}]}'>bold</strong>):<sup about="#mwt25" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-second_6-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"second"}}'><a href="#cite_note-second-6" id="mwUw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwVA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwVQ">[</span>6<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwVg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1244412712" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt26" id="mwVw" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Blockquote/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"quote","href":"./Template:Quote"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&lt;span style{{=}}\"color:gray\">In one respect this book is an experiment, and may chance to&lt;/span> {{strong|prove a failure}}&lt;span style{{=}}\"color:gray\">: I mean that I have not thought it neces&lt;/span>{{strong|sary to maintain throu}}&lt;span style{{=}}\"color:gray\">ghout the gravity of style which&lt;/span> {{strong|scientific writers usually}} &lt;span style{{=}}\"color:gray\">affect, and which has somehow&lt;/span> {{strong|come to be regarded as an}} &lt;span style{{=}}\"color:gray\">&apos;inseparable accident&apos; of scie&lt;/span>{{strong|ntific teaching. I never co}}&lt;span style{{=}}\"color:gray\">uld quite see the reasonab&lt;/span>{{strong|leness of this immemorial law:}} &lt;span style{{=}}\"color:gray\">subjects there are, no do&lt;/span>{{strong|ubt, which are in their essence}} &lt;span style{{=}}\"color:gray\">too serious to admit of any&lt;/span> {{strong|lightness of treatment – but}} &lt;span style{{=}}\"color:gray\">I cannot recognise Geome&lt;/span>{{strong|try as one of them. Neverthe}}&lt;span style{{=}}\"color:gray\">less it will, I trust, be fou&lt;/span>{{strong|nd that I have permitted my}}&lt;span style{{=}}\"color:gray\">self a glimpse of the comic side&lt;/span> {{strong|of things only at fitting sea}}&lt;span style{{=}}\"color:gray\">sons, when the tired reader might well&lt;/span> {{strong|crave a moment&apos;s}}&lt;span style{{=}}\"color:gray\"> breathing-space, and not on any occasion where it could endanger the continuity of the line of argument.&lt;/span>"}},"i":0}}]}'>.mw-parser-output .templatequote{overflow:hidden;margin:1em 0;padding:0 32px}.mw-parser-output .templatequotecite{line-height:1.5em;text-align:left;margin-top:0}@media(min-width:500px){.mw-parser-output .templatequotecite{padding-left:1.6em}}</style><blockquote class="templatequote " about="#mwt26" id="mwWA"><p><span style="color:gray">In one respect this book is an experiment, and may chance to</span> <strong>prove a failure</strong><span style="color:gray">: I mean that I have not thought it neces</span><strong>sary to maintain throu</strong><span style="color:gray">ghout the gravity of style which</span> <strong>scientific writers usually</strong> <span style="color:gray">affect, and which has somehow</span> <strong>come to be regarded as an</strong> <span style="color:gray">'inseparable accident' of scie</span><strong>ntific teaching. I never co</strong><span style="color:gray">uld quite see the reasonab</span><strong>leness of this immemorial law:</strong> <span style="color:gray">subjects there are, no do</span><strong>ubt, which are in their essence</strong> <span style="color:gray">too serious to admit of any</span> <strong>lightness of treatment – but</strong> <span style="color:gray">I cannot recognise Geome</span><strong>try as one of them. Neverthe</strong><span style="color:gray">less it will, I trust, be fou</span><strong>nd that I have permitted my</strong><span style="color:gray">self a glimpse of the comic side</span> <strong>of things only at fitting sea</strong><span style="color:gray">sons, when the tired reader might well</span> <strong>crave a moment's</strong><span style="color:gray"> breathing-space, and not on any occasion where it could endanger the continuity of the line of argument.</span></p></blockquote>
<div style="clear:both;" class="" about="#mwt28" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwWQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"clear","href":"./Template:Clear"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'></div>

<figure class="mw-default-size mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwWg"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Wiki_logo_The_Cunctator.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwWw"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Wiki_logo_The_Cunctator.png" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/Wiki_logo_The_Cunctator.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-file-width="135" data-file-height="133" data-file-type="bitmap" height="133" width="135" class="mw-file-element mw-file-upright" style="--mw-file-upright: 0.9" id="mwXA"/></a><figcaption id="mwXQ">The second Wikipedia logo</figcaption></figure>
<p id="mwXg">In November 2001, Wikipedia users began suggesting new logos for the website. A list of 24 leading candidates was chosen in the contest, which took place from November to December 2001. The winner was the last logo (#24), contributed by the user <i id="mwXw">The Cunctator</i>.<sup about="#mwt31" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-second_6-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"second"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-second-6"}}'><a href="#cite_note-second-6" id="mwYA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwYQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwYg">[</span>6<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwYw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwZA">The logo included the quote, taken from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Hobbes" title="Thomas Hobbes" id="mwZQ">Thomas Hobbes</a>'s 1651 book <i id="mwZg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leviathan_(Hobbes_book)" title="Leviathan (Hobbes book)" id="mwZw">Leviathan</a></i>, from chapter VI of part I, placed within the circle and distorted by the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fisheye_lens" title="Fisheye lens" id="mwaA">fisheye</a> effect. Underneath it was written "Wikipedia" in the capital letters, with W and A being slightly taller than the others. Beneath that was placed the motto of Wikipedia: <i id="mwaQ">The Free Encyclopedia</i>.<sup about="#mwt33" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-second_6-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"second"}}'><a href="#cite_note-second-6" id="mwag"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwaw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwbA">[</span>6<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwbQ">]</span></span></a></sup> The text used for the logo was (visible text in <strong about="#mwt32" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwbg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"strong","href":"./Template:Strong"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"bold"}},"i":0}}]}'>bold</strong>):</p>

<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1244412712" about="#mwt34" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwbw" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Blockquote/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"quote","href":"./Template:Quote"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&lt;span style{{=}}\"color:gray\">Desire to know why, and how, curiosity; such as is in no living creature but man: so that&lt;/span> {{strong|man is distinguished, not only by his reason, but also by this singular passion from other animals;}} &lt;span style{{=}}\"color:gray\">in whom the appetite of food, and other pleasures of sense, by predominance, take away the care of knowing causes;&lt;/span> {{strong|which is a lust of the mind, that by a perseverance of delight in the continual and indefatigable generation of knowledge, exceedeth the short vehemence of any carnal pleasure.}}"}},"i":0}}]}'/><blockquote class="templatequote " about="#mwt34" id="mwcA"><p><span style="color:gray">Desire to know why, and how, curiosity; such as is in no living creature but man: so that</span> <strong>man is distinguished, not only by his reason, but also by this singular passion from other animals;</strong> <span style="color:gray">in whom the appetite of food, and other pleasures of sense, by predominance, take away the care of knowing causes;</span> <strong>which is a lust of the mind, that by a perseverance of delight in the continual and indefatigable generation of knowledge, exceedeth the short vehemence of any carnal pleasure.</strong></p></blockquote>

<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt36" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwcQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"multiple image\n","href":"./Template:Multiple_image"},"params":{"align":{"wt":"right"},"width1":{"wt":"150"},"image1":{"wt":"Wikipedia 2NDLogo -FR.png"},"caption1":{"wt":"The logo of the [[French Wikipedia]] used until 2003"},"width2":{"wt":"150"},"image2":{"wt":"Wikipedia 2NDLogo -SE (transp).png"},"caption2":{"wt":"The logo of the [[Swedish Wikipedia]] used until 2003"}},"i":0}}]}'><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1349637415/mw-parser-output/.tmulti" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt37" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Multiple image/styles.css","wrapper":".tmulti"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'>.mw-parser-output .tmulti .multiimageinner{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .trow{display:flex;flex-direction:row;clear:left;flex-wrap:wrap;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .tsingle{margin:1px;float:left}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .theader{clear:both;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;align-self:center;background-color:transparent;width:100%}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .thumbcaption{background-color:transparent}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .text-align-left{text-align:left}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .text-align-right{text-align:right}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .text-align-center{text-align:center}@media all and (max-width:720px){.mw-parser-output .tmulti .thumbinner{width:100%!important;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:none!important;align-items:center}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .trow{justify-content:center}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .tsingle{float:none!important;max-width:100%!important;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .tsingle .thumbcaption{text-align:left}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .trow>.thumbcaption{text-align:center}}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .tmulti .multiimageinner .thumbimage{background-color:inherit}html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .tmulti .multiimageinner .thumbimage:not([style*="background-color"]) span:not(.skin-invert-image):not(.skin-invert):not(.bg-transparent) img,html.skin-theme-clientpref-day .mw-parser-output .tmulti .multiimageinner .thumbimage:not([style*="background-color"]) span:not(.bg-transparent) img{background-color:white}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .tmulti .multiimageinner .thumbimage:not([style*="background-color"]) span:not(.skin-invert-image):not(.skin-invert):not(.bg-transparent) img{background-color:white}}</style></span><div class="thumb tmulti floatright" about="#mwt36" id="mwcg"><div class="thumbinner multiimageinner" style="width:308px;max-width:308px"><div class="trow"><div class="tsingle" style="width:152px;max-width:152px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Wikipedia_2NDLogo_-FR.png" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Wikipedia_2NDLogo_-FR.png" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/Wikipedia_2NDLogo_-FR.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-file-width="215" data-file-height="204" data-file-type="bitmap" height="142" width="150" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></div><div class="thumbcaption">The logo of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_Wikipedia" title="French Wikipedia">French Wikipedia</a> used until 2003</div></div><div class="tsingle" style="width:152px;max-width:152px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Wikipedia_2NDLogo_-SE_(transp).png" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Wikipedia_2NDLogo_-SE_(transp).png" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/36/Wikipedia_2NDLogo_-SE_%28transp%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-file-width="245" data-file-height="238" data-file-type="bitmap" height="146" width="150" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></div><div class="thumbcaption">The logo of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swedish_Wikipedia" title="Swedish Wikipedia">Swedish Wikipedia</a> used until 2003</div></div></div></div></div>
<p id="mwcw">As the logo utilized text in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_language" title="English language" id="mwdA">English language</a>, its usage was not favored by other-language versions of Wikipedia. Some websites used similar designs with texts in their own languages. For example, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dutch_Wikipedia" title="Dutch Wikipedia" id="mwdQ">Dutch Wikipedia</a> used text from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multatuli" title="Multatuli" id="mwdg">Multatuli</a>'s 1860 <i id="mwdw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Max_Havelaar" title="Max Havelaar" id="mweA">Max Havelaar</a></i> classic book.<sup about="#mwt40" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-7" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-7"}}'><a href="#cite_note-7" id="mweQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mweg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwew">[</span>7<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwfA">]</span></span></a></sup> Other websites used the logo with English text, painted in the colours of the national flags. Such design was used for example by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danish_Wikipedia" title="Danish Wikipedia" id="mwfQ">Danish</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swedish_language" title="Swedish language" id="mwfg">Swedish</a> versions, using the flags of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Denmark" title="Denmark" id="mwfw">Denmark</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sweden" title="Sweden" id="mwgA">Sweden</a>, respectively.<sup about="#mwt43" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-8" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-8"}}'><a href="#cite_note-8" id="mwgQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwgg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwgw">[</span>8<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwhA">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt46" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-9" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-9"}}'><a href="#cite_note-9" id="mwhQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwhg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwhw">[</span>9<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwiA">]</span></span></a></sup> The other option used by some versions of Wikipedia was to design their own distinct logos, for example the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_Wikipedia" title="French Wikipedia" id="mwiQ">French Wikipedia</a>, which used the green circle with a white dove on it, as its logo.<sup about="#mwt49" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-10" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-10"}}'><a href="#cite_note-10" id="mwig"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwiw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwjA">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwjQ">]</span></span></a></sup> Additionally, some websites used a logo with English text in it, with the motto "The Free Encyclopedia" translated to their languages. It was done, for example, by the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/German_Wikipedia" title="German Wikipedia" id="mwjg">German Wikipedia</a>.<sup about="#mwt52" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-11" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-11"}}'><a href="#cite_note-11" id="mwjw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwkA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwkQ">[</span>11<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwkg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="3" id="mwkw" aria-labelledby="Puzzle_globe_(2003)"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Puzzle_globe_(2003)"><span id="Puzzle_globe_.282003.29" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span>Puzzle globe (2003)</h3></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt53" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwlA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"multiple image\n","href":"./Template:Multiple_image"},"params":{"align":{"wt":"right"},"width1":{"wt":"150"},"image1":{"wt":"Paullusmagnus-logo (large).png"},"caption1":{"wt":"Contest-winning puzzle ball logo by Paul Stansifer (&apos;&apos;Paullusmagnus&apos;&apos;)"},"width2":{"wt":"150"},"image2":{"wt":"Nohat-wiki-logo.png"},"caption2":{"wt":"Redesign of the logo by David Friedland (&apos;&apos;Nohat&apos;&apos;)"},"width3":{"wt":"122"},"image3":{"wt":"Old version of the Wikipedia logo used until 2010 (big, English).png"},"caption3":{"wt":"Final version of the logo adapted by Wikipedia in 2003"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1349637415/mw-parser-output/.tmulti" about="#mwt54" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Multiple image/styles.css","wrapper":".tmulti"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><div class="thumb tmulti floatright" about="#mwt53" id="mwlQ"><div class="thumbinner multiimageinner" style="width:434px;max-width:434px"><div class="trow"><div class="tsingle" style="width:152px;max-width:152px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Paullusmagnus-logo_(large).png" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Paullusmagnus-logo_(large).png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Paullusmagnus-logo_%28large%29.png/250px-Paullusmagnus-logo_%28large%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Paullusmagnus-logo_%28large%29.png/330px-Paullusmagnus-logo_%28large%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="600" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="bitmap" height="150" width="150" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></div><div class="thumbcaption">Contest-winning puzzle ball logo by Paul Stansifer (<i>Paullusmagnus</i>)</div></div><div class="tsingle" style="width:152px;max-width:152px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Nohat-wiki-logo.png" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Nohat-wiki-logo.png" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/Nohat-wiki-logo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-file-width="135" data-file-height="135" data-file-type="bitmap" height="150" width="150" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></div><div class="thumbcaption">Redesign of the logo by David Friedland (<i>Nohat</i>)</div></div><div class="tsingle" style="width:124px;max-width:124px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Old_version_of_the_Wikipedia_logo_used_until_2010_(big,_English).png" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Old_version_of_the_Wikipedia_logo_used_until_2010_(big,_English).png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Old_version_of_the_Wikipedia_logo_used_until_2010_%28big%2C_English%29.png/250px-Old_version_of_the_Wikipedia_logo_used_until_2010_%28big%2C_English%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-file-width="1058" data-file-height="1296" data-file-type="bitmap" height="149" width="122" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></div><div class="thumbcaption">Final version of the logo adapted by Wikipedia in 2003</div></div></div></div></div>

<section data-mw-section-id="4" id="mwlg" aria-labelledby="Contest"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Contest">Contest</h4></div>
<figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwlw"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Paul_Stansifer_at_the_Wikimedia_Foundation_in_front_of_the_Wikipedia_Puzzle_Globe_Logo.jpg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwmA"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Paul_Stansifer_at_the_Wikimedia_Foundation_in_front_of_the_Wikipedia_Puzzle_Globe_Logo.jpg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/Paul_Stansifer_at_the_Wikimedia_Foundation_in_front_of_the_Wikipedia_Puzzle_Globe_Logo.jpg/250px-Paul_Stansifer_at_the_Wikimedia_Foundation_in_front_of_the_Wikipedia_Puzzle_Globe_Logo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/Paul_Stansifer_at_the_Wikimedia_Foundation_in_front_of_the_Wikipedia_Puzzle_Globe_Logo.jpg/500px-Paul_Stansifer_at_the_Wikimedia_Foundation_in_front_of_the_Wikipedia_Puzzle_Globe_Logo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="5184" data-file-height="3456" data-file-type="bitmap" height="133" width="200" class="mw-file-element" id="mwmQ"/></a><figcaption id="mwmg">Paul Stansifer at the Wikimedia Foundation in front of a sculpture of the Wikipedia Puzzle Globe Logo</figcaption></figure>
<p id="mwmw">In 2003, following a suggestion by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erik_Möller" title="Erik Möller" id="mwnA">Erik Möller</a>, known under the username <i id="mwnQ">Eloquence</i>, an international logo contest was conducted to find a new logo that was suitable for all language versions of Wikipedia.<sup about="#mwt57" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-12" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-12"}}'><a href="#cite_note-12" id="mwng"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwnw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwoA">[</span>12<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwoQ">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt60" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-NYT-20070625_13-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"NYT-20070625"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-NYT-20070625-13"}}'><a href="#cite_note-NYT-20070625-13" id="mwog"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwow"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwpA">[</span>13<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwpQ">]</span></span></a></sup> After a two-stage voting process, a design by Paul Stansifer, at the time known under username <i id="mwpg">Paullusmagnus</i>, won with considerable support. His project depicted an unfinished globe constructed of puzzle pieces, of multiple colors. It was covered by text with links in various languages and writing systems, to symbolize the continuous construction and development of the project. It was made in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/POV-Ray" title="POV-Ray" id="mwpw">POV-Ray</a>, using a puzzle image wrapped around a sphere.<sup about="#mwt61" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-NYT-20070625_13-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"NYT-20070625"}}'><a href="#cite_note-NYT-20070625-13" id="mwqA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwqQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwqg">[</span>13<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwqw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwrA">A ratification vote was held soon after, to confirm community consensus. As a result, twelve direct adaptations of the design were created by members of the community. One of the propositions made by David Friedland, known under username <i id="mwrQ">Nohat</i>, was chosen. Friedland removed the color and changed the overlaid text into one letter or symbol per puzzle piece. His design included various characters from various writing systems. The writing in the logo used <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hoefler_Text" title="Hoefler Text" id="mwrg">Hoefler Text</a> font. </p>

<p id="mwrw">Before being officially released, the logo slightly lightened up and had replaced nearly obsolete <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kana" title="Kana" id="mwsA">kana</a> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wi_(kana)" title="Wi (kana)" id="mwsQ">wi</a> (<style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1351297085" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt62" id="mwsg" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Kana"},"2":{"wt":"ヰ"}},"i":0}}]}'>.mw-parser-output .script-Cprt{font-size:1.25em;font-family:"Segoe UI Historic","Noto Sans Cypriot",Code2001}.mw-parser-output .script-Hano{font-size:125%;font-family:"Noto Sans Hanunoo",FreeSerif,Quivira}.mw-parser-output .script-Latf,.mw-parser-output .script-de-Latf{font-size:1.25em;font-family:"Breitkopf Fraktur",UnifrakturCook,UniFrakturMaguntia,MarsFraktur,"MarsFraktur OT",KochFraktur,"KochFraktur OT",OffenbacherSchwabOT,"LOB.AlteSchwabacher","LOV.AlteSchwabacher","LOB.AtlantisFraktur","LOV.AtlantisFraktur","LOB.BreitkopfFraktur","LOV.BreitkopfFraktur","LOB.FetteFraktur","LOV.FetteFraktur","LOB.Fraktur3","LOV.Fraktur3","LOB.RochFraktur","LOV.RochFraktur","LOB.PostFraktur","LOV.PostFraktur","LOB.RuelhscheFraktur","LOV.RuelhscheFraktur","LOB.RungholtFraktur","LOV.RungholtFraktur","LOB.TheuerbankFraktur","LOV.TheuerbankFraktur","LOB.VinetaFraktur","LOV.VinetaFraktur","LOB.WalbaumFraktur","LOV.WalbaumFraktur","LOB.WeberMainzerFraktur","LOV.WeberMainzerFraktur","LOB.WieynckFraktur","LOV.WieynckFraktur","LOB.ZentenarFraktur","LOV.ZentenarFraktur"}.mw-parser-output .script-en-Latf{font-size:1.25em;font-family:Cankama,"Old English Text MT","Textura Libera","Textura Libera Tenuis",London}.mw-parser-output .script-it-Latf{font-size:1.25em;font-family:"Rotunda Pommerania",Rotunda,"Typographer Rotunda"}.mw-parser-output .script-Lina{font-size:1.25em;font-family:"Noto Sans Linear A"}.mw-parser-output .script-Linb{font-size:1.25em;font-family:"Noto Sans Linear B"}.mw-parser-output .script-Ugar{font-size:1.25em;font-family:"Segoe UI Historic","Noto Sans Ugaritic",Aegean}.mw-parser-output .script-Xpeo{font-size:1.25em;font-family:"Segoe UI Historic","Noto Sans Old Persian",Artaxerxes,Xerxes,Aegean}</style><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt62" id="mwsw">ヰ</span>) from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katakana" title="Katakana" id="mwtA">katakana</a> script with modern kana <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wa_(kana)" title="Wa (kana)" id="mwtQ">wa</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt64" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwtg" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Kana"},"2":{"wt":"ワ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt64" id="mwtw">ワ</span>) and small <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_(kana)" title="I (kana)" id="mwuA">i</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt66" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwuQ" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Kana"},"2":{"wt":"ィ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt66" id="mwug">ィ</span>). A <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smooth_breathing" title="Smooth breathing" id="mwuw">smooth breathing mark</a> before the Greek <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omega" title="Omega" id="mwvA">omega</a> (<style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1301836668" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt68" id="mwvQ" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles_greek.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Grek"},"2":{"wt":"Ω"}},"i":0}}]}'>.mw-parser-output .polytonic{font-family:"SBL Greek","SBL BibLit","New Athena Unicode","EB Garamond","EB Garamond 12","Foulis Greek","Garamond Libre","Noto Sans","Noto Serif","Cardo","Gentium Plus","Gentium Book Plus","Garamond","Palatino Linotype","DejaVu Sans","DejaVu Serif","FreeSerif","FreeSans","Arial Unicode MS","Lucida Sans Unicode","Lucida Grande","Code2000",sans-serif}</style><span title="Polytonic Greek" class="polytonic" about="#mwt68" id="mwvg">Ω</span>) was deleted and Russian <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Short_I" title="Short I" class="mw-redirect" id="mwvw">Short I</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt70" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwwA" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Cyrl"},"2":{"wt":"Й"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt70" id="mwwQ">Й</span>) replaced by Russian <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_(Cyrillic)" title="I (Cyrillic)" id="mwwg">I</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt72" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwww" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Cyrl"},"2":{"wt":"И"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt72" id="mwxA">И</span>). It was adopted by the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_Wikipedia" title="English Wikipedia" id="mwxQ">English Wikipedia</a> on 26 September 2003.<sup about="#mwt74" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-NYT-20070625_13-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"NYT-20070625"}}'><a href="#cite_note-NYT-20070625-13" id="mwxg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwxw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwyA">[</span>13<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwyQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="5" id="mwyg" aria-labelledby="Final_version"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Final_version">Final version</h4></div>
<p id="mwyw">The logo included 16 characters from 16 different writing scripts, many of which, but not all, chosen to represent due to their similarity to the letter <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/W" title="W" id="mwzA">W</a> from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_language" title="English language" id="mwzQ">English language</a>, as in the name Wikipedia. The alphabets represented were as follows:<sup about="#mwt75" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-NYT-20070625_13-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"NYT-20070625"}}'><a href="#cite_note-NYT-20070625-13" id="mwzg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwzw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mw0A">[</span>13<span class="cite-bracket" id="mw0Q">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

