<p id="mwAf0">The logo included several mistakes. Due to a formatting error:</p>
<ul id="mwAf4"><li id="mwAf8">letters <i id="mwAgA">va + i</i> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt184" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAgE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Deva"},"2":{"wt":"वि"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt184" id="mwAgI">वि</span>) from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devanagari" title="Devanagari" id="mwAgM">Devanagari</a> script were rendered incorrectly, being reversed in the process, showing as (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt186" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAgQ" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Deva"},"2":{"wt":"व​ि"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt186" id="mwAgU">व​ि</span>).</li>
<li id="mwAgY">In the combined letters <i id="mwAgc">va + i</i> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt188" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAgg" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Knda"},"2":{"wt":"ವಿ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt188" id="mwAgk">ವಿ</span>) from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kannada_script" title="Kannada script" id="mwAgo">Kannada script</a>, the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diacritic" title="Diacritic" id="mwAgs">diacritic</a> was attached to the wrong place.</li>
<li id="mwAgw">In the case of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_language" title="Japanese language" id="mwAg0">Japanese</a> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katakana" title="Katakana" id="mwAg4">katakana</a>, a wrong <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kana" title="Kana" id="mwAg8">kana</a> was used: <i id="mwAhA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wa_(kana)" title="Wa (kana)" id="mwAhE">wa</a></i> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt190" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAhI" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Kana"},"2":{"wt":"ワ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt190" id="mwAhM">ワ</span>) was mistakenly used instead of kana <i id="mwAhQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U_(kana)" title="U (kana)" id="mwAhU">u</a></i> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt192" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAhY" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Kana"},"2":{"wt":"ウ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt192" id="mwAhc">ウ</span>), forming <i id="mwAhg">wai</i> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt194" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAhk" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Kana"},"2":{"wt":"ワィ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt194" id="mwAho">ワィ</span>), instead of <i id="mwAhs">wi</i> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt196" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAhw" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Kana"},"2":{"wt":"ウィ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt196" id="mwAh0">ウィ</span>), which is present in the Japanese name of the website, <i id="mwAh4">Wikipedia</i> (<span title="Japanese-language text" about="#mwt198" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAh8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"ja"},"2":{"wt":"ウィキペディア"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="ja">ウィキペディア</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" about="#mwt198" id="mwAiA"/>).<sup about="#mwt199" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-NYT-20070625_13-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"NYT-20070625"}}'><a href="#cite_note-NYT-20070625-13" id="mwAiE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAiI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAiM">[</span>13<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAiQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul>
