="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Wikipedia_wordmark.svg" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Wikipedia_wordmark.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Wikipedia_wordmark.svg/330px-Wikipedia_wordmark.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Wikipedia_wordmark.svg/960px-Wikipedia_wordmark.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="500" data-file-height="85" data-file-type="drawing" height="45" width="263" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></div></div></div><div class="trow" style="display:flex"><div class="thumbcaption">Wikipedia logos used on the mobile application and website</div></div></div></div><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt201"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Pages_using_multiple_image_with_manual_scaled_images"/></span>
<p id="mwAlg">In late 2009, the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikimedia_Foundation" title="Wikimedia Foundation" id="mwAlk">Wikimedia Foundation</a> undertook the efforts to fix the errors and generally update the puzzle globe logo. Among other concerns, the original logo did not scale well and some letters appeared distorted.<sup about="#mwt206" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-14" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-14"}}'><a href="#cite_note-14" id="mwAlo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAls"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAlw">[</span>14<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAl0">]</span></span></a></sup> For the new logo, the Wikimedia Foundation defined which characters appear on the "hidden" puzzle pieces, and had a three-dimensional computer model of the globe created to allow the generation of other views.<sup about="#mwt210" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-15" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-15"}}'><a href="#cite_note-15" id="mwAl4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAl8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAmA">[</span>15<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAmE">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwAmI">The new design was published in May 2010. It features the new 3D rendering of the puzzle globe, as well as correct versions of previously wrong characters, including fixed versions of letters from Kannada and Devanagari, and usage of correct Japanese katakana characters. Additionally, several letters had been replaced by others. It included:<sup about="#mwt211" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-font1_2-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"font1"}}'><a href="#cite_note-font1-2" id="mwAmM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAmQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAmU">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAmY">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt214" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-16" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-16"}}'><a href="#cite_note-16" id="mwAmc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAmg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAmk">[</span>16<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAmo">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
<ul id="mwAms"><li id="mwAmw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ini_(Armenian_letter)" title="Ini (Armenian letter)" id="mwAm0">ini</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt215" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAm4" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Armn"},"2":{"wt":"Ի"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt215" id="mwAm8">Ի</span>) being replaced with <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vev_(letter)" title="Vev (letter)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAnA">vev</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt217" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAnE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Armn"},"2":{"wt":"Վ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt217" id="mwAnI">Վ</span>), both originating from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Armenian_alphabet" title="Armenian alphabet" id="mwAnM">Armenian alphabet</a>;</li>
<li id="mwAnQ">letter lo (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1350288068" about="#mwt219" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAnU" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles_khmer.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Khmr"},"2":{"wt":"ល"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="script-khmer" about="#mwt219" id="mwAnY">ល</span>) being replaced with combined letters vo and i (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1350288068" about="#mwt221" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAnc" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles_khmer.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Khmr"},"2":{"wt":"វិ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="script-khmer" about="#mwt221" id="mwAng">វិ</span>), both originating from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khmer_script" title="Khmer script" id="mwAnk">Khmer script</a>;</li>
<li id="mwAno">combined letters wa and i (<span style="font-family:'Noto Serif Tibetan', 'Babelstone Tibetan', 'Qomolangma-Sutung', 'Unifont';font-size:125%" about="#mwt223" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAns" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Tibt"},"2":{"wt":"ཝི"}},"i":0}}]}'>ཝི</span>) from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tibetan_script" title="Tibetan script" id="mwAnw">Tibetan script</a> being replaced by short u (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt224" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAn0" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Beng"},"2":{"wt":"উ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt224" id="mwAn4">উ</span>) letter from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bengali_alphabet" title="Bengali alphabet" id="mwAn8">Bengali alphabet</a>, while Tibetan character was moved elsewhere;</li>
<li id="mwAoA">letter Todo I (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1237794275" about="#mwt226" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAoE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:MongolUnicode/fonts.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"MongolUnicode","href":"./Template:MongolUnicode"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"ᡅ"},"2":{"wt":"h"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="font-mong" style="display:inline-block; font-weight:normal; font-size: 1.25em; line-height: 1.2em; ; vertical-align:middle; " about="#mwt226" id="mwAoI">ᡅ</span>) from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mongolian_script" title="Mongolian script" id="mwAoM">Mongolian script</a> being replaced by letter <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vini_(letter)" title="Vini (letter)" id="mwAoQ">vini</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt228" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAoU" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Geor"},"2":{"wt":"ვ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt228" id="mwAoY">ვ</span>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Georgian_scripts" title="Georgian scripts" id="mwAoc">Georgian Mkhedruli script</a>;</li>
<li id="mwAog"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radical_145" title="Radical 145" id="mwAok">radical 145</a>+5 strokes (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt230" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAoo" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Hans"},"2":{"wt":"袓"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt230" id="mwAos">袓</span>) from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_Chinese_characters" title="Simplified Chinese characters" id="mwAow">Simplified Chinese script</a> being replaced by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radical_120" title="Radical 120" id="mwAo0">radical 120</a>+8 strokes (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt232" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAo4" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Hant"},"2":{"wt":"維"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt232" id="mwAo8">維</span>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traditional_Chinese_characters" title="Traditional Chinese characters" id="mwApA">Traditional Chinese script</a>.</li>
<li id="mwApE">letter <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Resh" title="Resh" id="mwApI">resh</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1241449095" about="#mwt234" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwApM" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles_hebrew.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Hebr"},"2":{"wt":"ר"}},"i":0}}]}'/><bdi dir="rtl" class="script-hebrew" style="font-size:125%; " about="#mwt234" id="mwApQ">ר</bdi>) being replaced by letter <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waw_(letter)" title="Waw (letter)" id="mwApU">vav</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1241449095" about="#mwt236" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwApY" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles_hebrew.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Hebr"},"2":{"wt":"ו"}},"i":0}}]}'/><bdi dir="rtl" class="script-hebrew" style="font-size:125%; " about="#mwt236" id="mwApc">ו</bdi>), both originating from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hebrew_alphabet" title="Hebrew alphabet" id="mwApg">Hebrew alphabet</a>;</li>
<li id="mwApk">r (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1363986562" about="#mwt238" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwApo" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles_klingon.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Piqd"},"2":{"wt":""}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="script-klingon" about="#mwt238" id="mwAps"></span>) from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Klingon_scripts" title="Klingon scripts" id="mwApw">Klingon pIqaD script</a> being replaced by letter wə (<style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1308725858" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt240" id="mwAp0" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles_ethiopic.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Ethi"},"2":{"wt":"ው"}},"i":0}}]}'>.mw-parser-output .Ethiopic{font-family:"Abyssinica SIL","Noto Sans Ethiopic","Ebrima"}</style><span class="Ethiopic" about="#mwt240" id="mwAp4">ው</span>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ethiopic_script" title="Ethiopic script" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAp8">Ethiopic scripts</a>;</li>
<li id="mwAqA">letter <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yodh" title="Yodh" id="mwAqE">yodh</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1364256805" about="#mwt242" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAqI" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles_arabic.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Arab"},"2":{"wt":"ي"}},"i":0}}]}'/><bdi dir="rtl" class="script-arabic script-Arab" style="font-size:125%; " about="#mwt242" id="mwAqM">ي</bdi>) being replaced by letter <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waw_(letter)" title="Waw (letter)" id="mwAqQ">waw</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1364256805" about="#mwt244" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAqU" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles_arabic.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Arab"},"2":{"wt":"و"}},"i":0}}]}'/><bdi dir="rtl" class="script-arabic script-Arab" style="font-size:125%; " about="#mwt244" id="mwAqY">و</bdi>), both originating from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arabic_script" title="Arabic script" id="mwAqc">Arabic script</a>;</li>
<li id="mwAqg">letter cho (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt246" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAqk" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Thai"},"2":{"wt":"ฉ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt246" id="mwAqo">ฉ</span>) being replaced by combined letters wo waen and sara i (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt248" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAqs" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Thai"},"2":{"wt":"วิ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt248" id="mwAqw">วิ</span>), both originating from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thai_script" title="Thai script" id="mwAq0">Thai script</a>.</li></ul>

<p id="mwAq4">The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wordmark" title="Wordmark" id="mwAq8">wordmark</a> has been modified from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hoefler_Text" title="Hoefler Text" id="mwArA">Hoefler Text</a> font to the open-source <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Linux_Libertine" title="Linux Libertine" id="mwArE">Linux Libertine</a> font, and the subtitle was no longer italicized. The "W" character, which was used in various other places in Wikipedia, such as the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Favicon" title="Favicon" id="mwArI">favicon</a>, and was seen as a distinctive part of the Wikipedia brand, was stylized as crossed Vs in the original logo, while the W in Linux Libertine was rendered with a single line. To provide the traditional appearance of the Wikipedia "W", a "crossed" W was added as an <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OpenType" title="OpenType" id="mwArM">OpenType</a> variant to the Linux Libertine font.<sup about="#mwt250" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-font1_2-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"font1"}}'><a href="#cite_note-font1-2" id="mwArQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwArU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwArY">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwArc">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<section data-mw-section-id="7" id="mwArg" aria-labelledby="Glyphs_in_the_Wikipedia_logo_redesign_(2010)"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Glyphs_in_the_Wikipedia_logo_redesign_(2010)"><span id="Glyphs_in_the_Wikipedia_logo_redesign_.282010.29" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span>Glyphs in the Wikipedia logo redesign (2010)</h4></div>
<p id="mwArk">For the new logo, the entire surface of its globe was designed, including puzzle pieces hidden on the non-visible parts of the logo. In total, there were designed 51 puzzle pieces, of which 18 were visible in the logo. There were 21 empty spaces left, for the missing puzzle pieces.</p>

<p id="mwAro">The visible puzzle pieces are:<sup about="#mwt251" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-NYT-20070625_13-5" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"NYT-20070625"}}'><a href="#cite_note-NYT-20070625-13" id="mwArs"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwArw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAr0">[</span>13<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAr4">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt254" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-newcharacters_17-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"newcharacters"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-newcharacters-17"}}'><a href="#cite_note-newcharacters-17" id="mwAr8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAsA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAsE">[</span>17<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAsI">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
<ul id="mwAsM"><li id="mwAsQ">in the leftmost column, from the top down: capital letter <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vev_(letter)" title="Vev (letter)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAsU">vev</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt255" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAsY" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Armn"},"2":{"wt":"Վ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt255" id="mwAsc">Վ</span>, transcription: <i id="mwAsg">v</i>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Armenian_alphabet" title="Armenian alphabet" id="mwAsk">Armenian alphabet</a>, combined letters vo and i (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1350288068" about="#mwt257" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAso" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles_khmer.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Khmr"},"2":{"wt":"វិ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="script-khmer" about="#mwt257" id="mwAss">វិ</span>, transcription: <i id="mwAsw">vi</i>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khmer_script" title="Khmer script" id="mwAs0">Khmer script</a><sup about="#mwt259" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-18" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"note"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-18"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"refn","href":"./Template:Refn"},"params":{"group":{"wt":"note"},"1":{"wt":"Rotated on its side due to spacing issues."}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-18" data-mw-group="note" id="mwAs4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAs8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAtA">[</span>note 1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAtE">]</span></span></a></sup>, letter short u (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt262" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAtI" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Beng"},"2":{"wt":"উ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt262" id="mwAtM">উ</span>, transcription: <i id="mwAtQ">u</i>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bengali_alphabet" title="Bengali alphabet" id="mwAtU">Bengali alphabet</a>, combined letters va and i (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt264" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAtY" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Deva"},"2":{"wt":"वि"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt264" id="mwAtc">वि</span>, transcription: <i id="mwAtg">vi</i>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devanagari" title="Devanagari" id="mwAtk">Devanagari</a> script, letter <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vini_(letter)" title="Vini (letter)" id="mwAto">vini</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt266" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAts" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Geor"},"2":{"wt":"ვ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt266" id="mwAtw">ვ</span>, transcription: <i id="mwAt0">v</i>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Georgian_scripts#Mkhedruli" title="Georgian scripts" id="mwAt4">Georgian Mkhedruli script</a>;</li>
<li id="mwAt8">in the middle-left column, from the top down: capital letter <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omega" title="Omega" id="mwAuA">omega</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1301836668" about="#mwt268" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAuE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles_greek.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Grek"},"2":{"wt":"Ω"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span title="Polytonic Greek" class="polytonic" about="#mwt268" id="mwAuI">Ω</span>, transcription: <i id="mwAuM">o</i>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greek_alphabet" title="Greek alphabet" id="mwAuQ">Greek alphabet</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radical_120" title="Radical 120" id="mwAuU">radical 120</a> with 8 additional strokes (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt270" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAuY" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Hant"},"2":{"wt":"維"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt270" id="mwAuc">維</span>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin" title="Pinyin" id="mwAug">pinyin</a>: <i id="mwAuk">wei</i>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traditional_Chinese_script" title="Traditional Chinese script" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAuo">Traditional Chinese script</a>, combined letters va and i (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt272" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAus" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Knda"},"2":{"wt":"ವಿ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt272" id="mwAuw">ವಿ</span>, transcription: <i id="mwAu0">vi</i>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kannada_script" title="Kannada script" id="mwAu4">Kannada script</a>, combined letters wa and i (<span style="font-family:'Noto Serif Tibetan', 'Babelstone Tibetan', 'Qomolangma-Sutung', 'Unifont';font-size:125%" about="#mwt274" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAu8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Tibt"},"2":{"wt":"ཝི"}},"i":0}}]}'>ཝི</span>, transcription: <i id="mwAvA">wi</i>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tibetan_script" title="Tibetan script" id="mwAvE">Tibetan script</a>;</li>
<li id="mwAvI">in the middle-right column, from the top down: kanas <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U_(kana)" title="U (kana)" id="mwAvM">u</a> and small <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_(kana)" title="I (kana)" id="mwAvQ">i</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt275" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAvU" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Kana"},"2":{"wt":"ウィ"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt275" id="mwAvY">ウィ</span>, romanization: <i id="mwAvc">wi</i>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katakana" title="Katakana" id="mwAvg">katakana</a> script, capital letter <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/W" title="W" id="mwAvk">W</a> from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Latin_script" title="Latin script" id="mwAvo">Latin script</a>, capital letter <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_(Cyrillic)" title="I (Cyrillic)" id="mwAvs">i</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt277" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAvw" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Cyrl"},"2":{"wt":"И"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt277" id="mwAv0">И</span>, transcription: <i id="mwAv4">i</i>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cyrillic_script" title="Cyrillic script" id="mwAv8">Cyrillic script</a>, letter <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waw_(letter)" title="Waw (letter)" id="mwAwA">vav</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1241449095" about="#mwt279" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAwE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles_hebrew.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Hebr"},"2":{"wt":"ו"}},"i":0}}]}'/><bdi dir="rtl" class="script-hebrew" style="font-size:125%; " about="#mwt279" id="mwAwI">ו</bdi>, transcription: <i id="mwAwM">v</i>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hebrew_alphabet" title="Hebrew alphabet" id="mwAwQ">Hebrew alphabet</a>, combined letters va and i (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt281" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAwU" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Taml"},"2":{"wt":"வி"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Unicode" about="#mwt281" id="mwAwY">வி</span>, transcription: <i id="mwAwc">vi</i>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tamil_script" title="Tamil script" id="mwAwg">Tamil script</a>;</li>
<li id="mwAwk">in the rightmost column, from the top down: letter wə (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1308725858" about="#mwt283" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAwo" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles_ethiopic.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Ethi"},"2":{"wt":"ው"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="Ethiopic" about="#mwt283" id="mwAws">ው</span>, transcription: <i id="mwAww">wə</i>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ethiopic_script" title="Ethiopic script" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAw0">Ethiopic scripts</a>, isolated letter <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waw_(letter)" title="Waw (letter)" id="mwAw4">waw</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1364256805" about="#mwt285" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAw8" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Script/styles_arabic.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"script","href":"./Template:Script"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Arab"},"2":{"wt":"و"}},"i":0}}]}'/><bdi dir="rtl" class="script-arabic script-Arab" style="font-size:125%; " about="#mwt285" id="mwAxA">و</bdi>, transcription: <i id="mwAxE">w</i>) from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arabic_alphabet" title="Arabic alphabet" id="mwAxI">Arabic alphabet</a>, combined letters <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ㅇ" title="ㅇ" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAxM">ieung</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ㅜ" title="ㅜ" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAxQ">u</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ㅣ" title="ㅣ" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAxU">i</a> (<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1351297085" about="#mwt287" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAxY" data-mw