<p id="mwAx4">The puzzle pieces from the not visible portion of the logo are:<sup about="#mwt291" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-NYT-20070625_13-6" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"NYT-20070625"}}'><a href="#cite_note-NYT-20070625-13" id="mwAx8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAyA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAyE">[</span>13<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAyI">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt292" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-newcharacters_17-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"newcharacters"}}'><a href="#cite_note-newcharacters-17" id="mwAyM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAyQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAyU">[</span>17<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAyY">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
