<section data-mw-section-id="9" id="mwBZY" aria-labelledby="10th-anniversary_logo"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="10th-anniversary_logo">10th-anniversary logo</h3></div>
<figure class="mw-halign-left" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwBZc"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:English_Wikipedia_tenth_anniversary_logo.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBZg"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:English_Wikipedia_tenth_anniversary_logo.png" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/35/English_Wikipedia_tenth_anniversary_logo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-file-width="135" data-file-height="139" data-file-type="bitmap" height="139" width="135" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBZk"/></a><figcaption id="mwBZo">Tenth anniversary logo, which replaced the puzzle ball logo across Wikipedia on 15 January 2011</figcaption></figure>  
<p id="mwBZs">On 15 January 2011, a special logo replaced the standard globe on the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_Wikipedia" title="English Wikipedia" id="mwBZw">English Wikipedia</a> in order to mark the tenth anniversary of Wikipedia's founding. The logo depicts a single black jigsaw piece, representing the addition of another piece to the puzzle. On it is written "10 years".<sup about="#mwt624" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-19" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-19"}}'><a href="#cite_note-19" id="mwBZ0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBZ4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBZ8">[</span>18<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBaA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="10" id="mwBaE" aria-labelledby="20th-anniversary_logos"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="20th-anniversary_logos">20th-anniversary logos</h3></div>
